        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.45;background:#0f172a;color:#e5e7eb;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#f9fafb;\">Adoption and Optimization</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:4px;\">Continuous improvement and platform value signals for CS and leadership.</div>\n</div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:16px;\"><tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;width:33%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;color:#f9fafb;\">Questions this dashboard answers</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;color:#e5e7eb;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Is alert noise declining?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Are idle identities cleaned up?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Are coverage gaps closing?</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Are integrations healthy?</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;width:34%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;color:#f9fafb;\">Recommended review flow</div>\n<ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;color:#e5e7eb;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Alert trend + top datasources</strong> — Noise</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Idle access KPIs</strong> — Identity hygiene</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Coverage gap trends</strong> — Blind spots</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><strong>Integration failures</strong> — Routing health</li></ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f2937;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;width:33%;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;color:#f9fafb;\">Where to go next</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12px;color:#e5e7eb;\"><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Platform Value — 11 — close the loop</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Active Alerts — 21</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Access — 25</li><li style=\"margin:5px 0;\">Coverage — 24</li></ul>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;\">Tip: Empty or zero values may mean healthy state or missing tokens/LogicModules — confirm before concluding.</div>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>"
